WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Vent Simulator 2D demo opens on the simulator dashboard.

00:02.000 --> 00:04.000
The user changes ventilator mode and exports a JSON snapshot.

00:04.000 --> 00:06.000
The scenario changes to ARDS and the patient avatar shows worsening respiratory status.

00:06.000 --> 00:08.000
The scenario changes to pneumothorax with asymmetric lung findings.
